  "subject": "Dispositions on the three queued gap-proposals (audio attachment, recursive table fields, primary-index Phase 2): all three deferred to v1.5+ pickup queue with explicit promotion gates per gap; primary-index Phase 2 leads the queue when v1.5 cycle is triggered; audio defers indefinitely until second implementer; rich-Value internal structure designed alongside item-level-polymorphism + CA-007 Table-cell-translatability as a coordinated v1.5 value-shape bundle; updated v1.5 work pickup list attached for institutional memory; channel for future flows confirmed (catdef.org/mcp once operational, repo-PR until then)",

